    MC @ talk "ルッカン巡査と話す必要がある!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:8
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_897a6f98:

    # "Markus was unusually dripping with sweat, his face seemingly paler white than before."
    "マルクスは異様に汗を流しており、顔は以前より青白く見えた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:9
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_66683ae0:

    # MARKUS "I'm sorry, I just... I need to go, okay?"
    MARKUS "ごめんなさい、ちょっと…行かなきゃ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:10
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_efcf3d92:

    # MC @ talk "...Fine."
    MC @ talk "…わかった"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:11
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_4a32993e:

    # MARKUS "Meet me after at the Iron Unicorn, we can talk more there!"
    MARKUS "後でアイアンユニコーンで会いましょう、そこで詳しく話そう!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:13
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_dd722163:

    # "Markus hurried off before I could stop him."
    "マーカスは私が止めようとする前に、急いで立ち去った。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:14
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_8362d5b0:

    # MC @ talk "Markus!"
    MC @ talk "マークス!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:15
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_f8fb3fb3:

    # MC "(...Damn it, what's gotten into him?)"
    MC "(くそ……どうしやがった)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:16
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_246529dc:

    # MC "(I should head over to speak to Officer Lukkan as soon as possible.)"
    MC "(ルッカン巡査には、すぐに話をしに行くべきだ。)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:22
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_15273af3:

    # "Entering the city, I heard ringing of armour plates approaching from behind."
    "街に入ると、背後から鎧の軋む音が近づいてくるのが聞こえた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:28
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_9ff1ce7e:

    # GUARD "The Emperor wishes to speak to you."
    GUARD "皇帝が貴方にお話したいとの事です。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:29
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_b932b683:

    # GUARD "Right away."
    GUARD "すぐに。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:30
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_fcfd1a28:

    # MC @ think "The Emperor?"
    MC @ think "皇帝？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:31
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_d695d013:

    # MC @ talk "But, I'm supposed to report to-"
    MC @ talk "しかし、私は報告することになって――"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:32
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_195911eb:

    # GUARD "The Emperor wishes to hear your report directly."
    GUARD "皇帝が直々にあなたの報告を聞きたく、と仰っています。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:33
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_9b85a882:

    # MC @ talk "Where is he?"
    MC @ talk "彼はどこ？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:34
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_d5d543cb:

    # GUARD "He is waiting in Captain Nyx's Office."
    GUARD "彼はキャプテン・ニクスのオフィスで待っている。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:35
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_3f907879:

    # GUARD "He requests you come immediately."
    GUARD "すぐに来てほしいと、彼はおっしゃっていますよ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:36
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_f0b76b43:

    # MC "Well, lead the way then."
    MC "では、先導してください。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:40
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_7dc379c8:

    # "Upon entering Captain Nyx's Office, she was in a fierce mood as she argued with the stoic Emperor."
    "艦長ニクスのオフィスに入ると、彼女は沈黙の皇帝と激しく口論している最中で、険しい表情を浮かべていた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:46
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_fabade8f:

    # NYX @ angry "I have no more men to pull! My resources are stretched thin as it is!"
    NYX @ angry "これ以上動員できる兵士などいない!　今だって手一杯なのに!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:47
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_d544e067:

    # ALCOTT @ talk "Did Lukkan not send you that someone from the Adventurers Guild?"
    ALCOTT @ talk "ルッカンは冒険者ギルドからの誰かをあなたに送らなかったのですか？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:48
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_f42166ff:

    # ALCOTT @ talk "Did he not succeed in his tasks as instructed?"
    ALCOTT @ talk "彼は指示通りに任務を遂行できなかったのか？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:49
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_413a23ba:

    # NYX @ angry "Y-Yes!"
    NYX @ angry "は、はい!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:50
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_b6e613a3:

    # NYX @ angry "But it was a band wrap solution to a gaping wound!"
    NYX @ angry "だけどそれは、深い傷にバンドで包んだだけの解決策だった!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:51
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_3783ce75:

    # NYX @ angry "I need {i}more{/i} men to keep this city under control! Not less!"
    NYX @ angry "この街を統制するには、今より{i}もっと{/i}人手が必要なんだ!減らすんじゃない!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:52
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_1f135222:

    # ALCOTT @ talk "Then I will pull some lower tier Adventurers from their quests to assist you for a few months till the situation settles."
    ALCOTT @ talk "それでは、下位ランクの冒険者をクエストから引き抜き、状況が落ち着くまで数か月間、貴方のサポートに充てよう。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:53
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_85d58729:

    # ALCOTT @ talk "But for now, it's far more important some of your men are posted elsewhere."
    ALCOTT @ talk "しかし今のところは、はるかに重要なのは、あなたの部下の一部を他の場所に配置することだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:54
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_381ff1e6:

    # "Captain Nyx stared in disbelief."
    "ニクス艦長は、信じられないという目つきで見つめた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:55
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_33ced028:

    # NYX @ shock "...{i}The Adventurers Guild?{/i}"
    NYX @ shock "…{i}冒険者ギルド？{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:56
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_f0d187ab:

    # NYX @ angry "Emperor... Please, I need trained men."
    NYX @ angry "皇帝…どうか、訓練された兵士を私にお貸しください。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:57
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_570f78ed:

    # NYX @ angry "Not a bunch of undisciplined mercenaries!"
    NYX @ angry "なにものでもない、無規律な傭兵の集団!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:58
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_95a85796:

    # ALCOTT @ angry "Captain Nyx, you will follow orders whether you like them or not, are we clear?"
    ALCOTT @ angry "キャプテン・ニックス、お前は好むと好まざるとに命令に従う。分かったな？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:59
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_b1118b3b:

    # NYX "...Yes... Emperor."
    NYX "はい…皇帝…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:60
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_9dc3c60d:

    # NYX "My apologies for my conduct."
    NYX "私の行いをお詫びいたします。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:61
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_e64ef127:

    # "The Emperor finally turned to notice me stood waiting in the doorway."
    "皇帝はようやく振り返り、ドアの前に立ち待つ私に気づいた。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:62
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_98335569:

    # ALCOTT @ talk "Ah, there you are."
    ALCOTT @ talk "ああ、そこにいたのか。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:63
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_a29f96a6:

    # ALCOTT @ talk "Captain Nyx, you are dismissed."
    ALCOTT @ talk "Nyx艦長、貴官は解任とする。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:64
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_2bf3e2d4:

    # NYX @ shock "But this is my-"
    NYX @ shock "でも　これは俺の—"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:65
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_67f093d8:

    # ALCOTT @ angry "I would speak with my man now, {i}alone.{/i}"
    ALCOTT @ angry "我が者と今、話したい、{i}一人で。{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:66
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_a73acec6:

    # ALCOTT @ angry "You are dismissed, Captain Nyx."
    ALCOTT @ angry "ニックス艦長、帰ってよい。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:67
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_93c383a5:

    # NYX "...Very well, Emperor."
    NYX "…承知しました、皇帝。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:68
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_8ade1e4a:

    # "Captain Nyx after bringing her fist against her chest in a salute, turned to leave."
    "ニクス艦長は、胸の前で拳を突き上げ敬礼すると、踵を返して去ろうとした。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:71
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_ed969e90:

    # "As she passed by me, we both shared a knowing glance as the guards closed the door behind her."
    "彼女が私の横を通り過ぎると、警備員が彼女の後ろのドアを閉めるのと同時に、私たちは意味深な視線を交わした。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:75
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_bbda2531:

    # ALCOTT @ talk "So, what news do you bring?"
    ALCOTT @ talk "さて、どんな知らせだ？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:76
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_a6fe90e1:

    # ALCOTT @ talk "And where is your friend? I had the two of you sent."
    ALCOTT @ talk "あなたの友達はどこ？二人を送ったはずだが。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:77
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_c2e57570:

    # MC @ talk "He's fine, just... Perhaps a little shaken by what we saw."
    MC @ talk "彼は大丈夫、ただ……さっきの出来事に少し揺らいでるのかもしれません。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:78
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_6125bb1e:

    # "Alcott raised an eyebrow at the comment, waiting on me to elaborate."
    "アルコットはその発言に眉を上げ、私が説明するのを待っている。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:80
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_caa1b21f:

    # "After relaying the events to him to the best of my knowledge..."
    "わたしの知る限りの出来事を彼に伝えると…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:88
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_8e5b9894:

    # ALCOTT @ talk "...Hmm, I see."
    ALCOTT @ talk "…ふむ、なるほど。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:89
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_515de8c1:

    # ALCOTT @ talk "So another major offensive is likely being planned soon."
    ALCOTT @ talk "そうして近いうちに新たな大規模攻勢が計画されているのでしょう。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:90
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_6bddee75:

    # ALCOTT @ talk "It is as I feared."
    ALCOTT @ talk "やはり、恐れていた通りだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:91
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_82fa4775:

    # MC @ think "Uhh, you don't seem very surprised."
    MC @ think "えっと、あまり驚いてないみたいだね。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:92
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_e896e76d:

    # ALCOTT @ talk "That's because I'm not."
    ALCOTT @ talk "だって、違うんだもの。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:93
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_cda1b98f:

    # ALCOTT @ talk "I've known for quite some time about their dark {i}Emperor.{/i}"
    ALCOTT @ talk "ずっと前から知っていた、彼らの闇の{i}皇帝{/i}のことを。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:94
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_a65f726f:

    # "I felt my heart sink into my stomach, turning pale white as I took a step back in disbelief."
    "信じられない気持ちで一歩後ずさりすると、心臓が胃の底に沈んでいくのを感じ、顔色が蒼白になった。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:95
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_406e523a:

    # "They knew... After all these years of telling us the Demorai were nothing more than savage monsters of primitive mind, {i}they knew the truth.{/i}"
    "彼らは知っていた… 長年デモライを原始的な野蛮な怪物に過ぎないと言い続けておきながら、{i}彼らは真実を知っていたのだ。{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:96
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_b431e554:

    # MC @ surprised "You... {i}You knew?{/i}"
    MC @ surprised "あなたは…{i}知っていたの？{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:97
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_d7350415:

    # MC @ surprised "But... The Demorai... They're not supposed to be-"
    MC @ surprised "でも…デモライ…あいつら、そんなはずがないー"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:98
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_2851dedb:

    # ALCOTT @ angry "As far as most people are concerned, the Demorai are just savage beasts ready to rip and tear."
    ALCOTT @ angry "大抵の人にとって、デモライはただ引き裂く残忍な獣に過ぎない。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:99
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_e7ea30f8:

    # ALCOTT @ talk "It is best for everyone's sake we keep it that way."
    ALCOTT @ talk "みんなのためにも、このままにしておくのが一番だ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:100
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_e22de872:

    # ALCOTT @ talk "Muddying the waters only invites unnecessary divisive discussions."
    ALCOTT @ talk "水を濁すことは、不要な対立議論を招くだけだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:105
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_rootMenu_8b289247:

    # ALCOTT @ talk "It is a soft lie that the Demorai are unintelligible savages."
    ALCOTT @ talk "デモライが理解不能な野蛮人だというのは、優しい嘘である。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:106
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_rootMenu_dc64c7cf:

    # ALCOTT @ angry "Make no mistake, intelligent or not, their only goal is to see our destruction."
    ALCOTT @ angry "はっきり言って、彼らが知性的であろうとなかろうと、彼らの唯一の目的は我々の滅びを望んでいるということだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:107
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_rootMenu_1eaa1316:

    # ALCOTT @ talk "We must keep that {i}ethical debate{/i} door shut, for questioning our means will only lead us astray."
    ALCOTT @ talk "その{i}倫理的議論{/i}の扉は閉ざしたままにせねばならない。手段を問い始めれば、我々は道を踏み外すだけだからだ。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:108
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_rootMenu_509e5fae:

    # ALCOTT @ talk "We must focus on military victory only; we cannot afford to be distracted and risk dividing ourselves further."
    ALCOTT @ talk "軍事上の勝利にのみ集中しなければならない、気を散らし、さらなる分裂を危険にさらす余裕はない。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:111
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_rootMenu_136c0ac1:

    # ALCOTT @ joy "Ha!"
    ALCOTT @ joy "はっ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:112
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_rootMenu_3b36fad1:

    # ALCOTT @ angry "Listen to me now, and listen good, boy."
    ALCOTT @ angry "よく聞け、小僧。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:113
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_rootMenu_832d1377:

    # ALCOTT @ talk "The Demorai have zero interest in any sort of {i}negotiations{/i} while their 'Emperor' rules over them."
    ALCOTT @ talk "デモライは『皇帝』が支配する限り、どのような{i}交渉{/i}にもまったく興味がありません。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:114
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_rootMenu_0a615b3b:

    # MC @ talk "But why? Why are they doing all this?"
    MC @ talk "しかし、一体なぜ？なぜ彼らはこんなことをしているの？"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:115
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_rootMenu_5ada5ffe:

    # ALCOTT @ talk "Even I do not know that..."
    ALCOTT @ talk "私でさえ、それは知らない…"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:116
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_rootMenu_a5ca9e15:

    # ALCOTT @ talk "But I know for us there is no seat for us at any negotiations table."
    ALCOTT @ talk "しかし、私たちにとって、いかなる交渉の席にも私たちの場所はないことを知っています。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:117
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_rootMenu_b9e9e364:

    # ALCOTT @ talk "We are no more to them than vermin that need to be wiped out."
    ALCOTT @ talk "我々は彼らにとって、ただの害獣だ。駆除されるべき。"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/TwoEmperors/scr_3.rpy:119
translate ja qst_TwoEmperors_3_guardDebrief_rootMenu_f3683e6e:

    # ALCOTT @ talk "I don't have all day, so speak quickly."
    ALCOTT @ talk "一日中暇じゃないんだ、早く話せよ。"

